{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KILL THE KING is a medieval survival horror game where you are the\u00a0king, trapped inside your own castle after revolting peasants stormed the gates. They've slaughtered your knights. Butchered your family - <i>your own blood.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But those filthy peasants weren't just angry... they've become <i>something</i> far worse, and\u00a0it\u00a0wants your head on a pike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE HEREBY PREY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That villainous beast is thirsty for royal blood...\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It roams the halls of the keep, searching for any living thing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in the shadows, Stay quiet. Pray it doesn't find you cowering in the dark like the coward you've become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It yields not to iron and steel. Run, and find items to aid in your survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVERANCE OR DAMNATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once home to lavish feasts and sordid celebrations, the keep's walls are now a tomb - lowborn and nobility rotting together in the dark. Unless you find a way to get the gates open, you'll be joining them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a dark, sprawling castle and solve increasingly sadistic puzzles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge and use whatever you can get your hands on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what you must to survive and escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059730?t=1764250132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059730?t=1764250132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059730/1e2776ecfdd057df72864fb9d8124f7592eadcaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764250132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059730/1e2776ecfdd057df72864fb9d8124f7592eadcaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764250132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Low-fidelity violence and gore and other disturbing content including death and dark themes\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KILL THE KING is a medieval survival horror game where you are the\u00a0king, trapped inside your own castle after revolting peasants stormed the gates. They've slaughtered your knights. Butchered your family - <i>your own blood.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But those filthy peasants weren't just angry... they've become <i>something</i> far worse, and\u00a0it\u00a0wants your head on a pike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE HEREBY PREY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That villainous beast is thirsty for royal blood...\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It roams the halls of the keep, searching for any living thing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in the shadows, Stay quiet. Pray it doesn't find you cowering in the dark like the coward you've become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It yields not to iron and steel. Run, and find items to aid in your survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVERANCE OR DAMNATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once home to lavish feasts and sordid celebrations, the keep's walls are now a tomb - lowborn and nobility rotting together in the dark. Unless you find a way to get the gates open, you'll be joining them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a dark, sprawling castle and solve increasingly sadistic puzzles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge and use whatever you can get your hands on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what you must to survive and escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Snapsro"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059730/75005c7b13b9b538ef94e53a83f266be7178dca7/header.jpg?t=1764250132","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"KILL THE KING","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Snapsro"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nViol\u00eancia Extrema\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogen\nDrastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059730/045cfa8e865040482615f56d7bc8b5a49677744a/ss_045cfa8e865040482615f56d7bc8b5a49677744a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764250132","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059730/045cfa8e865040482615f56d7bc8b5a49677744a/ss_045cfa8e865040482615f56d7bc8b5a49677744a.600x338.jpg?t=1764250132"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059730/a46416f1c3ef4431f86c27733f240b58a9dd4685/ss_a46416f1c3ef4431f86c277